			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140340201,
					"content": "And so, the monsters were eradicated, and the sorcerer was defeated.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340202
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Played by Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340202,
					"content": "Peace soon returned to the capital. Those in the court manipulated by the sorcerer also recognized the errors of their ways...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340203
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Played by Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340203,
					"content": "Some remembered the names of the heroes who saved their kingdom, but others simply continued their lives none the wiser.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340204
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Played by Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340204,
					"content": "Such is the story of the Marechaussee Hunters. They pursue the phantoms in the darkness and exterminate all who pose a threat...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340205
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Played by Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340205,
					"content": "They will always protect the city and those within it, even should all memory of their accomplishments be forgotten by the very people they serve.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340206
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde",
					"speakerSubtitle": "Played by Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340206,
					"content": "Whew... I'm assuming we've finally reached the end of the script?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340207
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Furina"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340207,
					"content": "Yes. You've reached one of the better endings.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340208
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340208,
					"content": "It's a pretty solid story overall. I thought it was just an ordinary adventure at first, but the further we got into it, the more impressed I became with the production and the plot.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340209
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Furina"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340209,
					"content": "That final battle especially! All the effects were super realistic.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340210
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Furina"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340210,
					"content": "Right, yeah, hehe... totally.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340211
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340211,
					"content": "Ah... That's a really good point. I never expected the weapons we picked up from that vault would have that kind of effect.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340212
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lyney"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340212,
					"content": "Yeah, mine nearly scared the daylights out of me when it started glowing! I took a good look at it after we got out, but I don't think it ever lit up again.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340213
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Furina"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340213,
					"content": "Oh, we should probably give these props back, right? I'll just leave mine here.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340214
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Furina"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340214,
					"content": "Did you have a good time?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340215
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340215,
					"content": "Of course. Let me know if another script like this comes around!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340216
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Furina"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340216,
					"content": "Sure, no problem.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340217
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340217,
					"content": "Then, I'll head back for now. I think I need some time to fully digest everything that just happened.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340218
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Furina"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340218,
					"content": "Once Mr. Florian is awake, please pass on my regards to him. He must be extremely exhausted, to have passed out cold like that.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340219
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Furina"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340219,
					"content": "You're right. He's had a lot to deal with.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340220
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340220,
					"content": "Well, see you all some other time! Toodle-oo!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340221
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Furina"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340221,
					"content": "...Okay, so, can I ask now?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340222
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340222,
					"content": "I think it should be fine, yeah.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340223
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lyney"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340223,
					"content": "What in the world was going on back there?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340224
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340224,
					"content": "...Ah, so you saw through all of that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340225
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340225,
					"content": "Ahahaha... That time in the cave when you told us to close our eyes... It'd be weirder if we didn't notice anything.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340226
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lyney"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340226,
					"content": "I was dying of curiosity the entire time! I mean, you did a pretty bang-up job of pretending nothing had gone wrong. Furina actually looked like she thought all of it was planned...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340227
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340227,
					"content": "Guess none of us wanted to be the one to break the illusion.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340228
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lyney"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340228,
					"content": "Huh? What are you all talking about?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340229,
						140340231
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340229,
					"content": "Yeah, what's going on?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340230
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340230,
					"content": "Wait, don't tell me you never...! Ah, this is all my fault. It's not too late to cover your ears! Here, partner, I'll do it for you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340233,
					"content": "Um... Bit late for that, don't you think?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340234
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lyney"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340234,
					"content": "Uh... You're saying... Everything that happened back there wasn't actually part of the script?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340235
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340235,
					"content": "It's probably more accurate to say this was never a real scripted story to begin with.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340236
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340236,
					"content": "Whaaat!?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340237
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340237,
					"content": "...So loud... My head...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340238
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Florian"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340238,
					"content": "Hey, you! Get up right now and explain yourself!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340239
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340239,
					"content": "Ahhhhh! No shaking, please! My head...!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340240
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Florian"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340240,
					"content": "Florian explains the truth to everyone...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_BLACK_SCREEN",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340241
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340241,
					"content": "D—Did Paimon just hear that right? You guys made up that whole last part on the spot?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340242
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340242,
					"content": "It's not nice to lie to people, but.... Paimon's gotta admit, that was a really good story, Florian. Oh, and nice improvisation, Clorinde!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340243
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340243,
					"content": "Yeah! It was like watching a magician improvise a spectacular magic trick after forgetting an important prop.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340244
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lyney"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340244,
					"content": "If Paimon knew something was wrong with that vault, she would've floated straight in the opposite direction!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340245
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340245,
					"content": "Everything was under control.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340246
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340246,
					"content": "As if you've ever described a situation as being \"out of control.\" I'm pretty sure any situation you consider to be easy to handle would scare a reasonable person half to death!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340247
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340247,
					"content": "Guess I'm just used to it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340248
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340248,
					"content": "Uh... You must run into a lot of unexpected situations, then... That explains why you're so good at coming up with things on the spot...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340249
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340249,
					"content": "As for you, Florian...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340250
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340250,
					"content": "...I know there's no excuse for what I did. I'll turn myself in to the Gardes at once, confess my crimes, and accept any punishment that comes my way.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340251
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Florian"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340251,
					"content": "I would say you've already suffered more than enough.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340252
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340252,
					"content": "...What?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340253
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Florian"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340253,
					"content": "You may have been blinded by fame and fortune in the beginning, but your actions during the final battle had proven you to be a true Marechaussee Hunter.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340254
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340254,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340255
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Florian"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340255,
					"content": "You'll be far more use to the city above ground than below. Your job as a Hunter is more important.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340256
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340256,
					"content": "But...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340257
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Florian"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340257,
					"content": "Of course, you'll still need to take the keys and pay a personal visit to the two Hunters you wronged. Prepare to accept any terms they give you as well.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340258
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340258,
					"content": "...Yes, of course.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340259
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Florian"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340259,
					"content": "As far as I'm concerned, though... Your showing in the duel was enough to prove your honor.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340260
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340260,
					"content": "...! Then, I'll do exactly as you said. I... I'll go return those two keys right now.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340261
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Florian"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340261,
					"content": "Thank you so much, everyone. I'll do my best to prove myself worthy of the second chance you've given me. I swear this on my name and honor as a Marechaussee Hunter.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340262
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Florian"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340262,
					"content": "Until we meet again, everyone.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Florian"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340231,
					"content": "I was just playing along too...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340232
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340232,
					"content": "Wait, don't tell me Paimon never...! Ah, this is all my fault. It's not too late to cover your ears! Here, Paimon, I'll do it for you!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340233
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				}
			]
		},
		{
			"id": 1403403,
			"completionStepIds": [
				1403403,
				1403404,
				1403405,
				1403406,
				1403407,
				1403408,
				1403409,
				1403410,
				1403411
			],
			"beginWay": "TALK_BEGIN_MANUAL",
			"beginConditions": {
				"logic": "LOGIC_NONE",
				"conditions": [
					{
						"type": "QUEST_COND_STATE_EQUAL",
						"rawParams": [
							"1403403",
							"2"
						],
						"stepId": 1403403,
						"stateName": "QUEST_STATE_UNFINISHED"
					}
				]
			},
			"mark": "TALK_MARK_NONE",
			"trigger": {
				"objectNames": [
					"Clorinde"
				],
				"points": [
					{
						"sceneId": 3,
						"position": [
							2525.035,
							469.746,
							4803.685
						],
						"pointId": 340300464
					}
				]
			},
			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 140340301,
					"content": "Speaking of Marechaussee Hunters... What should we do about the \"treasure\" in that cave?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340302
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lyney"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340302,
					"content": "Leave it be.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340303
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340303,
					"content": "Are you sure? We could show it to people, make it so that the Hunters are remembered... Don't you want that?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340304
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340304,
					"content": "No. Every name on that tablet made the same choice. All Hunters know what the path entails.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340305
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340305,
					"content": "I am no exception... My identity as a Marechaussee Hunter is not something I need people to remember. I wish only to be recognized as a Champion Duelist, nothing more.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340306
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340306,
					"content": "That's certainly very different from the path of a magician. Still, I admire your decision.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340307
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lyney"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340307,
					"content": "Wait, Paimon just remembered something. If there were no special effects involved, why did our weapons begin to glow during the battle?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340308
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340308,
					"content": "That's because the Marechaussee Hunters of ages past would often imbue their weapons with special enchantments to suppress the monsters. Whenever a monster was nearby, their weapons would start to glow.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340309
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340309,
					"content": "Ooh! So that's why they had an effect on that guy near the end. I really thought the summons were doing all the work.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340310
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340310,
					"content": "Well, I'm sure the summons were a part of it, too.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340311
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340311,
					"content": "Oh? How so?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340312
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lyney"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340312,
					"content": "This particular Devorator probably hailed from the same era as the Hunters we saw in the room.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340313
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340313,
					"content": "The names you recited all belonged to the bravest Hunters. Countless monsters fell to their blades. That's likely why the Devorator visibly reacted when you said them out loud.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340314
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340314,
					"content": "So the names held the power all along...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340315
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340315,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340316
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340316,
					"content": "Navia, everything you said during your \"summon\"...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340317
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340317,
					"content": "Huh? Ah—hahaha! I um, I meant what I said. I mean, it was true to my character! So, yeah, I'm glad you heard it, just don't make me repeat myself. It's embarrassing!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340318
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340318,
					"content": "I really appreciated those words.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340319
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340319,
					"content": "Alright, alright. Don't get all sentimental on me.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340320
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340320,
					"content": "Uhh... Anyway, let's not talk about that anymore! I'm going to go on ahead. Don't fall too far behind, now!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340321
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Navia"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340321,
					"content": "Ah... She ran off.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340322
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340322,
					"content": "I should probably head back as well. This story was truly incredible. I might have to spend the whole night telling my siblings all about it!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340323
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lyney"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340323,
					"content": "See you later.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340324
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340324,
					"content": "Mhm, Goodbye!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340325
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Lyney"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340325,
					"content": "...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340326
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340326,
					"content": "#{NICKNAME}... Should your name and deeds be forgotten, what do you think the significance of your journey will be?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340327
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Clorinde"
				},
				{
					"id": 140340327,
					"content": "(...)",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340328
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340328,
					"content": "I suppose the significance would be the journey itself and the world we helped create. There's still value in the time I shared with everyone here, in the things we were able to accomplish, even if no one remembers them.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340329
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 140340329,
					"content": "A great answer. I'll remember it.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						140340330
